cmux/integrations bundles @cmux/integrations-core (libs/integrations-core in
https://github.com/manaflow-ai/cmux; its cmux code is GPL-3.0-or-later, see
libs/integrations-core/LICENSE, LICENSE-executor and NOTICE) into dist/main.js. That package contains code adapted from executor
https://github.com/UsefulSoftwareCo/executor (commit 98d606bd2b47b9dcc2c03a129a14b5134d9852c8)

Adapted files (each keeps a header naming its upstream paths and the changes):

  libs/integrations-core/src/policy.ts         packages/core/sdk/src/policies.ts
                                               packages/plugins/openapi/src/sdk/invoke.ts (annotationsForOperation)
                                               packages/plugins/graphql/src/sdk/plugin.ts (annotationsFor)
                                               packages/plugins/mcp/src/sdk/plugin.ts (toToolDef)
  libs/integrations-core/src/openapi.ts        packages/plugins/openapi/src/sdk/extract.ts
                                               packages/plugins/openapi/src/sdk/openapi-utils.ts (DocResolver)
  libs/integrations-core/src/openapi-paths.ts  packages/plugins/openapi/src/sdk/definitions.ts
  libs/integrations-core/src/openapi-auth.ts   packages/plugins/openapi/src/sdk/preview.ts (security schemes and presets)
  libs/integrations-core/src/graphql.ts        packages/plugins/graphql/src/sdk/extract.ts
                                               packages/plugins/graphql/src/sdk/introspect.ts (types)
                                               packages/plugins/graphql/src/sdk/plugin.ts (tool naming)
  libs/integrations-core/src/mcp.ts            packages/plugins/mcp/src/sdk/manifest.ts
                                               packages/plugins/mcp/src/sdk/types.ts (McpToolAnnotations)

No telemetry, billing, analytics, registry-fetch or credential-storage code was copied.
This file is the notice that ships with the app bundle.

